        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Obtain the Tyrande shrine and complete its gauntlet while protecting any healing-specialization character.\n\n1. Enter End Time through the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. Use the dungeon's transit device to check the two available echoes. You need EMERALD Dragonshrine, Echo of Tyrande. If absent, leave before killing a boss and reset an unsaved instance to reroll, respecting the entry limit.\n\n2. For the simplest high-level attempt, use a damage or tank specialization. Comments identify healing SPECIALIZATION, rather than the Dungeon Finder role icon, as the healer check. If a healer is present, keep them safely out of the shadow creatures' attacks throughout the gauntlet.\n\n3. Move from one illuminated moonwell area to the next, bringing shadow creatures into the light so they can be killed. Clear the full gauntlet without letting a healing-specialization character take damage, then engage the now-available Tyrande. Credit normally appears at engagement; verify it before finishing the boss.",
