        difficultyReason = "Damage Mannoroth while preserving Varo'then until the sacrifice has happened.",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Damage Mannoroth while preserving Varo'then until the sacrifice has happened.\n\n1. Enter Well of Eternity through the Caverns of Time and follow the Illidan and Tyrande storyline through Peroth'arn and Queen Azshara. At the final encounter, leave Captain Varo'then ALIVE and target Mannoroth instead.\n\n2. Use controlled damage to bring Mannoroth to about 90%, then wait for him to sacrifice Varo'then and heal himself. His 'Your blood is MINE, elf!' line confirms the intended event. Do not kill Varo'then yourself while setting this up; disable pet cleaves and damage effects that could hit him.\n\n3. After the sacrifice, interact with Varo'then's dropped blade and use it against Mannoroth as directed by the encounter. Kill the demons threatening Tyrande, continue damaging Mannoroth and let the final Illidan sequence finish. Check achievement credit after the encounter.\n\n4. Later high-level reports also describe a direct Mannoroth kill, but the controlled sacrifice route makes the criterion explicit. The dungeon quest can still need your own Varo'then kill, so plan a separate run for that quest if he was sacrificed instead.",
