        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Kill approaching assault drakes and prevent every small Twilight Barrage from damaging the ship.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Kill approaching assault drakes and prevent every small Twilight Barrage from damaging the ship.\n\n1. Enter Dragon Soul and clear through Ultraxion, then board the Skyfire and start the defense. For a dedicated attempt, use Normal and bring ranged attacks or helpers to cover both sides of the deck.\n\n2. Target Twilight Assault Drakes as they approach and kill each wave promptly. Watch the SMALL Twilight Barrage circles and have a player stand in each circle before impact if a drake gets a cast off. Cover both sides rather than chasing only the boarding enemies.\n\n3. Kill Twilight Sappers before they reach the ship's vulnerable area, and handle the larger Twilight Onslaught separately; it is not the small Twilight Barrage named by the achievement. Continue through the defense until Goriona and Blackhorn arrive.\n\n4. Finish Blackhorn with no unsoaked small barrages having damaged the Skyfire. Ranged /target Twilight Assault Drake attacks simplify covering incoming drakes; a very fast boss kill after a failed defense does not repair the criterion.",
