        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete each named boss and allow scripted finales to finish.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete each named boss and allow scripted finales to finish.\n\n1. Set legacy Raid Difficulty to Normal or Heroic. Enter Dragon Soul through the northeast raid portal INSIDE the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. Its outdoor Wyrmrest Temple counterpart is not the entrance. Defeat Morchok, Zon'ozz and Yor'sahj, use the temple transports for Hagara, return to the summit and speak to Thrall through the drake-defense dialogue to unlock Ultraxion and the Skyfire.\n\n2. Clear the first wing through Hagara, return to Wyrmrest's summit and speak to Thrall. Complete the drake-defense event and wait through the dialogue, then defeat Ultraxion and loot his cache.\n\n3. Board the Skyfire, defeat the drake waves and sappers, then Goriona and Warmaster Blackhorn. Use the offered next dialogue and transition to Spine.\n\n4. On Spine, kill three Corruption tentacles and leave one alive. Anchor in a dead tentacle's hole with Grasping Tendrils for a planned roll to discard unwanted Amalgamations. Kill Corrupted Bloods, keep ONE Hideous Amalgamation alive and lead it across the blood residue until its Absorbed Blood is at NINE stacks. Current Heroic can supply all nine from a single residue, so inspect its buff rather than counting nine bodies.\n\n5. Bring that nine-stack Amalgamation directly against the next HEADWARD armor plate, then kill it there. Its Nuclear Blast lifts the plate: immediately kill the exposed Burning Tendon. Repeat for all three plates. Between planned rolls, alternate left/right to cancel the roll warning or remain anchored in a hole; an unanchored completed roll throws you off.\n\n6. At the Maelstrom, speak to Thrall. Visit all four Aspect platforms using their wind jumps and defeat each large limb and Mutated Corruption. Return to the starting platform for Deathwing's head, finish the encounter and open the Greater Cache. For a Heroic Madness kill, clear the preceding Dragon Soul encounters on Heroic in the same progression.\n\n7. Check Ultraxion, Blackhorn, Spine and Madness. This wing achievement includes those four encounters; the separate Destroyer's End title specifically needs a Normal or Heroic Deathwing kill.",
