        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "The legacy encounter still requires its scripted phases or coordinated movement.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The legacy encounter still requires its scripted phases or coordinated movement.\n\n1. Set the legacy raid to HEROIC before entry. Enter Dragon Soul through the northeast raid portal INSIDE the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. Its outdoor Wyrmrest Temple counterpart is not the entrance. Defeat Morchok, Zon'ozz and Yor'sahj, use the temple transports for Hagara, return to the summit and speak to Thrall through the drake-defense dialogue to unlock Ultraxion and the Skyfire.\n\n2. On Spine, kill three Corruption tentacles and leave one alive. Anchor in a dead tentacle's hole with Grasping Tendrils for a planned roll to discard unwanted Amalgamations. Kill Corrupted Bloods, keep ONE Hideous Amalgamation alive and lead it across the blood residue until its Absorbed Blood is at NINE stacks. Current Heroic can supply all nine from a single residue, so inspect its buff rather than counting nine bodies. Bring that nine-stack Amalgamation directly against the next HEADWARD armor plate, then kill it there. Its Nuclear Blast lifts the plate: immediately kill the exposed Burning Tendon. Repeat for all three plates. Between planned rolls, alternate left/right to cancel the roll warning or remain anchored in a hole; an unanchored completed roll throws you off.\n\n3. Finish the actual encounter and verify Heroic: Spine of Deathwing before leaving. A Normal or Raid Finder kill does not satisfy this criterion, and old progression-era DPS or item-level targets are unnecessary at high level.",
