        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "A high-level legacy clear; follow the dungeon's progression events and final-boss requirement.",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A high-level legacy clear; follow the dungeon's progression events and final-boss requirement.\n\n1. Set Dungeon Difficulty to Heroic before entering Well of Eternity. A different difficulty or a similarly named raid is not the requested clear.\n\n2. Complete End Time and its offered continuation if Well of Eternity access is locked, then enter Well of Eternity through its Caverns of Time portal. Follow Illidan and accept his stealth support.\n\n3. Move through the portal-defense section with Illidan, kill the required defenders and close all three portals as directed. Let the NPCs enter combat and finish their dialogue so the next objective unlocks. Defeat Peroth'arn, then follow the route through Queen Azshara's encounter.\n\n4. At the final battle, handle Varo'then and Mannoroth, use Varo'then's dropped weapon against Mannoroth and clear the demons threatening Tyrande. Stay with Illidan through the concluding scripted phase until Mannoroth's defeat awards credit. If doing That's Not Canon!, use its sacrifice setup instead of killing Varo'then yourself.",
