        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "A high-level burst avoids the eyes; otherwise circle the arena edge without being detected.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A high-level burst avoids the eyes; otherwise circle the arena edge without being detected.\n\n1. Enter Well of Eternity through the Caverns of Time and follow Illidan's stealth section. Close the three required portals after defeating their defenders and allow Illidan's combat and dialogue to advance before moving on.\n\n2. At Peroth'arn, a high-level direct burst can kill him before the eye-search phase and award the achievement. If he disappears instead, stop trying to damage the hidden boss and concentrate on avoiding the eyes.\n\n3. Move continuously around the outer edge near the fire boundary, giving each Eye of Peroth'arn space. With a group, agree on a direction and follow together so players do not lead eyes into each other. Survive the entire search without ANY party member being detected, then kill Peroth'arn when he returns.",
