        name = "Taste the Rainbow!",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Taste the Rainbow!",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Observe four absorbed ooze-color pairs during one living Yor'sahj encounter.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Observe four absorbed ooze-color pairs during one living Yor'sahj encounter.\n\n1. Enter Dragon Soul on Heroic if possible, because four oozes per wave make combinations quicker. Reach Yor'sahj, remove passive damage and start without killing him. The initial trash oozes do not count.\n\n2. Allow each encounter wave's oozes to reach Yor'sahj. Record these simultaneous pairs in his absorbed color buffs: BLACK/YELLOW, BLACK/BLUE, RED/GREEN and PURPLE/YELLOW. A four-color wave can satisfy several pairs at once.\n\n3. Keep waiting through additional waves in the SAME fight until you have personally seen all four pairs. The live achievement checklist can fail to update before the boss dies, so use your own notes or observed buffs rather than waiting indefinitely for checkboxes.\n\n4. Once all four combinations have occurred, kill Yor'sahj and check credit. Do not end the encounter after merely seeing four individual colors; the required PAIRS must coexist.",
