        name = "Severed Ties",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Severed Ties",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Wait for one Calling of the Highborne phase and kill two ghouls in that same phase.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Wait for one Calling of the Highborne phase and kill two ghouls in that same phase.\n\n1. Enter End Time in the Caverns of Time and check its transit device. You need RUBY Dragonshrine, Echo of Sylvanas. If absent, leave before any boss kill and reset an unsaved instance to try again, respecting the hourly entry limit.\n\n2. Engage Sylvanas with proximity or a non-damaging pull and stop attacking. Wait for Calling of the Highborne to create the ring of Risen Ghouls. A high-level instant kill before the ring prevents this achievement.\n\n3. Kill at least TWO of the ring's ghouls during that SINGLE Calling phase, then kill Sylvanas when she returns. One ghoul in each of two phases is insufficient. Keep pets passive until the needed ghouls have appeared.",
