        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Eclipse",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Control Benedictus's health, then kill ten sparks around the outer ring before finishing him.",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Control Benedictus's health, then kill ten sparks around the outer ring before finishing him.\n\n1. Enter Hour of Twilight in the Caverns of Time and escort Thrall through Arcurion and Asira Dawnslayer to Archbishop Benedictus. Disable attacking pets, damage procs and automatic retaliation before the final pull.\n\n2. Carefully lower Benedictus until Twilight Epiphany changes the room to purple and Twilight Sparks appear, around 60% in recent Retail comments. Stop attacking him as soon as the phase starts. Use Whole-Body Shrinka' before combat if your normal hit would kill him; old fixed hit counts do not transfer between levels.\n\n3. Kill TEN Twilight Sparks around the outside of the circular arena, leaving Benedictus alive. Use ranged attacks where possible and watch your health while crossing the damaging outer area. Remove a damage-reduction toy buff after the phase begins if it makes killing sparks unnecessarily slow.\n\n4. After ten sparks are credited, kill Benedictus. If controlled player damage is impossible, comments report letting Thrall slowly bring him to the transition instead, which can take roughly eighteen minutes. Do not attempt to use Soft Foam Sword inside this dungeon.",
