        difficultyReason = "Burst Morchok or spread all players during every Black Blood channel.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Burst Morchok or spread all players during every Black Blood channel.\n\n1. Enter Dragon Soul on Normal or Heroic and clear the approach around Morchok. At high level, kill him before he reaches Black Blood of the Earth; a fast kill without the phase meets the achievement.\n\n2. If Black Blood occurs, spread immediately after the pull-in effect while using the rock fragments for protection. In 10-player mode no two players may be within five yards; in 25-player mode two together are allowed, but three together fail it.\n\n3. Remain spread until the channel ends, repeat for any later channel and finish Morchok. Predetermine positions if using a group so several players do not choose the same fragment.",
