    [6175] = {
        achievementId = 6175,
        name = "Holding Hands",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Holding Hands",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Build a lightning chain that includes every present player when Hagara's final conductor activates.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Build a lightning chain that includes every present player when Hagara's final conductor activates.\n\n1. Enter Dragon Soul and reach Hagara. A dedicated 10-player Normal attempt has recent Midnight confirmations, including a character plus a passive pet. Bring a helper if your class cannot position a pet. This achievement remains separate from the current Dragon Soul mount meta.\n\n2. Clear her starting trash, engage without killing her and use controlled damage to reach her special phases. Remove damaging procs and use a damage-reduction toy before combat if needed. Survive the ice phase if it comes first; destroy an Ice Tomb or have a helper or pet free trapped players.\n\n3. In the LIGHTNING phase, kill the Bound Lightning Elemental beside a Crystal Conductor to charge it. Position players, and a passive pet if used, in a STRAIGHT LINE between the charged conductor and the next, with each link close enough to transmit lightning.\n\n4. Repeat around the room, adjusting the chain to charge the remaining conductors. When the FINAL conductor activates, EVERY player present must be part of that final Lightning Conduit. Simply charging all conductors with someone standing disconnected does not meet the criterion.\n\n5. Watch for the achievement at the final activation; killing Hagara is not needed to make this interaction credit appear. Recent comments report different results between modes and sensitive pet positioning, so use actual credit rather than only her stun animation as proof of success.",
