    [6177] = {
        achievementId = 6177,
        name = "Destroyer's End",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Destroyer's End",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Clear Dragon Soul through its scripted Spine and Madness encounters on Normal or Heroic.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Clear Dragon Soul through its scripted Spine and Madness encounters on Normal or Heroic.\n\n1. Enter Dragon Soul through the northeast raid portal INSIDE the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. Its outdoor Wyrmrest Temple counterpart is not the entrance. Defeat Morchok, Zon'ozz and Yor'sahj, use the temple transports for Hagara, return to the summit and speak to Thrall through the drake-defense dialogue to unlock Ultraxion and the Skyfire.\n\n2. Defeat Ultraxion after Thrall's summit event, then complete the Skyfire defense and defeat Blackhorn. Continue through the offered dialogue to Spine.\n\n3. On Spine, kill three Corruption tentacles and leave one alive. Anchor in a dead tentacle's hole with Grasping Tendrils for a planned roll to discard unwanted Amalgamations. Kill Corrupted Bloods, keep ONE Hideous Amalgamation alive and lead it across the blood residue until its Absorbed Blood is at NINE stacks. Current Heroic can supply all nine from a single residue, so inspect its buff rather than counting nine bodies.\n\n4. Bring that nine-stack Amalgamation directly against the next HEADWARD armor plate, then kill it there. Its Nuclear Blast lifts the plate: immediately kill the exposed Burning Tendon. Repeat for all three plates. Between planned rolls, alternate left/right to cancel the roll warning or remain anchored in a hole; an unanchored completed roll throws you off.\n\n5. At the Maelstrom, speak to Thrall. Visit all four Aspect platforms using their wind jumps and defeat each large limb and Mutated Corruption. Return to the starting platform for Deathwing's head, finish the encounter and open the Greater Cache. For a Heroic Madness kill, clear the preceding Dragon Soul encounters on Heroic in the same progression.\n\n6. Stay through Deathwing's actual defeat and check Destroyer's End. The title requires Normal or Heroic; a Raid Finder-only Deathwing kill does not meet this achievement.",
