    [6180] = {
        achievementId = 6180,
        name = "Chromatic Champion",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Chromatic Champion",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Four different opening platforms must be completed on the same character across weekly Madness kills.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Four different opening platforms must be completed on the same character across weekly Madness kills.\n\n1. Choose ONE character for the entire achievement. Enter Dragon Soul on Normal or Heroic, clear through Spine and inspect which of the four opening Aspects remain unchecked. Warbands do not combine unfinished platform criteria from four different characters.\n\n2. At Madness, Thrall stands on Ysera's platform. From there Nozdormu is one platform left, Alexstrasza two left and Kalecgos one right. Plan an unchecked first assault before speaking to Thrall.\n\n3. For distant Alexstrasza, jump Ysera-to-Nozdormu and back before starting to build the Carrying Winds movement buff. Speak to Thrall, immediately rush through Nozdormu to Alexstrasza and wait there for Deathwing to announce the first Aspect assault. Use movement abilities; the assault begins faster than some old videos show.\n\n4. For any chosen opening, let the first assault and its Mutated Corruption establish before killing the limb. Then clear the other three platforms, return for Deathwing's head and finish the encounter. Check the actual criterion after the kill rather than an external tracker's provisional platform name.\n\n5. Return on that SAME character after each weekly reset and repeat with a different missing first Aspect until all four are credited. Changing Normal/Heroic in the same weekly Dragon Soul progression does not provide four independent attempts, so plan at least four weekly kills.",
