        },
        tips = "This is the still-obtainable Cataclysm Rogue chain. It does not use Pandaria's removed legendary-cloak storyline, and no guild raid is needed for the personal daggers. The weeks required depend on cluster and gem drops; there is no guaranteed completion date.",
